Full remediation of the security & integrity audit performed at commit
a2f2e14 (see docs/BACKEND_AUDIT.md and docs/FRONTEND_AUDIT.md for the
complete findings with file:line references). 107 files changed across
backend (Express + Prisma) and frontend (React + Vite).

Security
--------
- Mass-assignment whitelists: explicit editable-key picks replace raw
  req.body spreads across 9 controllers (salesReturn, purchaseReturn,
  backOrder, production shifts/batches, quality, expense, machine,
  process, project incl. tasks) so clients can no longer overwrite id,
  number, status, createdAt or createdById.
- User privilege-escalation guards: roleId/password/isActive changes
  gated to SUPERADMIN or hierarchyLevel<=1; target-role hierarchy check
  (cannot assign a role at or above own level); department scoping via
  assertSameDepartment.
- Attachment permission gates: REF_PERMISSIONS enforced on
  list/upload/download/delete; multer fileFilter allowlist (pdf/images/
  office + txt/csv by extension AND mimetype); Content-Disposition with
  sanitized server-derived filename; stream error handler.
- Tally integration: SSRF allowlist (private-LAN/localhost/env
  TALLY_ENDPOINT only, public endpoints rejected with 400); xmlEscape on
  all interpolated values; guard HttpErrors now surface their real
  status codes instead of a generic 500.
- OTP: crypto.randomInt generation, throttle on request, updateMany
  invalidation of previous unconsumed OTPs, dev code never logged in
  production; email trim+lowercase via zod preprocess.
- multer bumped to ^2.0.2; express 'trust proxy' set (correct client IPs
  behind the reverse proxy for rate limiting).

Stock integrity
---------------
- Atomic conditional stock decrement (updateMany with qty guard,
  count===0 -> 400 insufficient): removes the TOCTOU read-modify-write
  race in stockService.
- Dispatch CANCELLED now reverses per-line stock in a transaction with
  DISPATCH_CANCEL StockLedger rows; guards against DELIVERED and
  double-cancel.
- Jobwork receive: status guards (ISSUED/PARTIAL_RECEIVED), per-line cap
  received+rejected <= qtySent, lines must belong to the challan,
  rejected qty returned to company stock, COMPANY lines require itemId.
- Race-free document numbering: new NumberSequence table
  (migration 20260905100000_number_sequence) with SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
  + in-process per-key mutex + insert-retry; first use seeds from real
  max document number. Eliminates duplicate DC/INV numbers under
  concurrency.
- Item create with openingStock>0 now writes an OPENING StockLedger row
  in the same transaction.

Financial integrity
-------------------
- Invoice lifecycle guards: cannot cancel an invoice with payments;
  cannot edit lines/totals once PAID; payments rejected on CANCELLED,
  non-positive amounts and overpay (baseline = aggregate(_sum) floored
  by denormalized amountPaid so legacy data cannot be overpaid);
  isIntraState persisted from igst presence.
- Sales/purchase returns: cumulative (non-CANCELLED) returned-qty caps
  per invoice line / GRN line, with line-belongs-to-anchor validation.
- GRN: requires an APPROVED/PARTIALLY_RECEIVED/RECEIVED PO, poLineId
  must belong to the PO, GRN party must match PO party; status stripped
  from update bodies.

Frontend
--------
- ErrorBoundary wrapping the app with a recoverable error card.
- Unguarded optional-join crash fixes (InvoiceView, PurchaseOrderView,
  JobcardView, ChecklistWidget, CustomerMaterial*, StockManagementPage,
  QuotationView, RolesPage).
- Vendor Work Orders module now routed and navigable, incl. new detail
  page (VendorWorkOrderView) wiring SendToVendorModal, RecordReturnModal
  and VendorWorkOrderTrail; sidebar entry gated on vendorWorkOrder.read.
- numberToWords: negatives ("Minus ..."), whole-paise rounding,
  zero-rupees and paise-only cases fixed.
- Analytics pages: error cards with Retry instead of eternal spinners.
- Permission layer fail-closed and wired into navigation and destructive
  actions (delete/approve/adjust) with SUPERADMIN bypass.
- Double-submit guards (saving flag + disabled + "Saving...") on 15
  forms and modals.
- DataTable: loading skeleton, error banner with Retry, and
  no-matches filtered empty states; wired into 21 list pages.
- IST-safe date prefills via todayLocal()/toLocalInput() (replaces 15
  toISOString() shifts).
- 401 bursts toast once ("Session expired") before a single redirect;
  debounced search + request sequencing on hot list pages.

Ops
---
- Seed no longer resets the admin password on re-run (passwordHash only
  in upsert create clause).
- jobcard.progress and stock.adjust permissions seeded and granted
  (stock.adjust -> Admin/SUPERADMIN only).
- Dashboard KPI consistency: invoicesLast30Days excludes CANCELLED.

Docs
----
- docs/BACKEND_AUDIT.md and docs/FRONTEND_AUDIT.md: full findings with
  severity and file:line references; drove this remediation.

Verified: prisma migrate deploy (28 migrations), seed idempotent,
eslint 0 errors (backend & frontend), live smoke tests via port 3000
(login, dispatch cancel stock-reversal 180->175->180, tally exports 200,
payment guards 400).
